  "details": "When the VRChat instance I am currently in is closing (e.g., due to it being too old), the VRChat client application unexpectedly closes completely (crashes to desktop).\n\nThe expected behavior is that the client should automatically transition me to my designated Home World instance upon the closure of the current instance. Instead, I am forced to manually relaunch the entire game.\n\nSupporting Information:\n\nLogs: I have attached available log files from sessions where this issue may have occurred. Please note that some logs might contain unrelated errors from other sessions or issues.\n\nSpecific Log with Potential Correlation: The log file named output_log_2025-04-19_15-09-43.txt (attached) shows repeated Udon errors occurring near the end of the session.\n\nWorld Context for Udon Errors: These Udon errors were observed while I was in the following world instance, which might be related to the instability leading to the crash during the instance closing process:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_1b482eca-bede-4de8-88a8-bbb6ca7e24cd&instanceId=09325~region(eu)\n\nWhile the Udon errors might be specific to that world, the client crashing instead of returning home upon any instance closure seems to be the primary bug or if that is intended to happen please feel free to close this :)",
